# Telegram structure snapshots (BTC/ETH FOCUS: chart + watch zones + context)
# 1. Message @BotFather → /newbot → copy token
# 2. Start a chat with your bot (or add it to a group)
# 3. Get chat id: open https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates after sending the bot a message

